"ACS880 control word CW and statusword SW are not
easy to understand :-)

ABB_ACS880MotorAggr function:
This Plc code is done in a way that allows start/stop,
\"flying\" restart and switch between remote/local mode via
converters panel during running. Only one exception i.e.
if converter are in local and switches over to remote, operator
must in manual mode give a new start command from PLC. "
